            "review_title": "Review at Sol Pizza",
            "review_text": "Swati P\nBengaluru, India60 contributions\n0\nGreat Pizza place at Tay Ho!\nNov 2024 • Couples\nSol is a chic little pizza place - great for a casual night out with friends. The pizzas here are amazing - we tried their White - multi cheese with onion speciality & Nduja know pizza - topped with sliced Nduja sausage, peppers & sundried tomatoes..paired that with some wine and brewed beers and you are good to go!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 3, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
